│ effectiveness trials carefully tailored to local health needs and conducted at scale in developing countries is      │
│ required."}, {"study_index": 7, "title": "Costs and benefits of community postnatal support workers: a randomised    │
│ controlled trial", "abstract": "OBJECTIVES This study aimed to measure the effect and the total cost per woman of    │
