│ general health perception domain of the Short Form-36 at 6 weeks. Secondary outcomes were mean Edinburgh Postnatal   │
│ Depression Scale (EPDS), Duke Functional Social Support (DUFSS) scores and breastfeeding rates. RESULTS The 623      │
│ randomised women were well-matched by group with a good response to follow-up. At 6 weeks there was no evidence of a │
